{
  "description": "How the host turns 'twoFinger' gesture messages into output for the front app's profile (gestures.delivery, fallbacks). Each case feeds 'messages' in order to a fresh router; each message lists the outputs it produces, in order. Message fields: phase (began|changed|ended|cancelled), scale (magnification change since the last message), rotation (degrees since the last message, counter-clockwise +), dx/dy (tablet points); 'panScale' (screen points per tablet point) multiplies dx/dy. Outputs: {gestureBegin|gestureEnd: zoom|rotation} (trackpad gesture bracket), {magnify: amount, phase}, {rotate: degrees, phase}, {scroll: [dx, dy], phase} (screen points), {zoomScroll: pixels, phase} (modifier+scroll, scale × 300), {shortcut: zoomIn|zoomOut|rotateLeft|rotateRight} (the profile fallback pressed), {fallbackUnavailable: zoom|rotate} (no shortcuts; reported once per gesture). Rules: shortcuts accumulate across messages within a gesture, one press per zoomStep (default 0.25) or rotateStepDegrees (default 15) with zoom added up in log space (see 'steps'), at most 3 presses per axis per message with the excess whole steps dropped and the fractional remainder carried; counter-clockwise is rotateLeft. A gesture's end resets everything. In native delivery rotation starts only once the accumulated rotation reaches 3°, and one bracket (named by whichever of zoom/rotation started first) wraps the gesture. A 'began' while a gesture is open first cancels the open one. Without zoom shortcuts, 'shortcuts' delivery zooms with zoomScroll. 'scroll' delivery: zoomScroll for zoom, rotation ignored. Shortcut outputs also carry 'message', the literal keyShortcut to post; compare only the members the expected output lists. 'host' (default mac) resolves the stored modifiers. 'steps' (FallbackAccumulator.feedDeltas): twoFinger -> fallback shortcut steps (gestures.delivery = shortcuts). Zoom adds up in log space: acc += ln(max(0.05, 1 + scale)); one step = ln(1 + zoomStep); steps = trunc(acc / step), acc -= steps * step. Rotation adds up in degrees, one step per rotateStepDegrees, counter-clockwise positive. Each result is clamped to +-maxStepsPerMessage AFTER the remainder is taken (the excess is dropped). A zoomStep or rotateStepDegrees <= 0 means the schema default (0.25, 15). 'expect' is [zoom, rotate]: zoom > 0 = zoomIn steps, < 0 = zoomOut; rotate > 0 = rotateLeft, < 0 = rotateRight. A feed of {\"reset\": true} (gesture began / ended) drops both remainders. 'pan' (gestures.pan; absent = scroll, an unknown value = scroll) delivers the pan: scroll as {scroll}, middleDrag and spaceDrag as {panDrag: [dx, dy], via, phase} in screen points: began once the pan since the last press adds up to 4 points (with the whole amount), changed moves, ended/cancelled release; a drag in flight is released (panDrag [0, 0] ended) before any shortcut or zoomScroll output of the same message and begins again with the next pan. Fallback shortcuts with a 'hosts' entry for the host press that entry.",
  "fallbacks": {
    "standard": {"zoomIn": {"key": {"char": "+", "hid": 46}, "modifiers": 8}, "zoomOut": {"key": {"char": "-", "hid": 45}, "modifiers": 8}, "rotateLeft": {"key": {"char": "4"}, "modifiers": 0}, "rotateRight": {"key": {"char": "6"}, "modifiers": 0}, "rotateStepDegrees": 15, "zoomStep": 0.25},
    "defaultSteps": {"zoomIn": {"key": {"char": "+", "hid": 46}, "modifiers": 8}, "zoomOut": {"key": {"char": "-", "hid": 45}, "modifiers": 8}, "rotateLeft": {"key": {"char": "4"}, "modifiers": 0}, "rotateRight": {"key": {"char": "6"}, "modifiers": 0}},
    "none": {},
    "perHost": {"zoomIn": {"key": {"char": "+", "hid": 46}, "modifiers": 8, "hosts": {"windows": {"key": {"char": "=", "hid": 46}, "modifiers": 8}}}, "zoomOut": {"key": {"char": "-", "hid": 45}, "modifiers": 8}}
  },
  "maxStepsPerMessage": 3,
  "cases": [
    {"name": "zoom shortcuts accumulate across messages", "delivery": "shortcuts", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 2, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "scale": 0.1, "expect": []}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": 0.1, "expect": []}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": 0.1, "expect": [{"shortcut": "zoomIn"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": -0.2, "expect": []}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": -0.2, "expect": [{"shortcut": "zoomOut"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": 0.6, "expect": [{"shortcut": "zoomIn"}]}, {"phase": "ended", "expect": []}], "note": "log-space: after +0.06 (one step pressed) and two -0.2 (one out pressed), +0.6 reaches 1.39 steps: one zoomIn (linear accumulation would press two)", "source": "PadMac"},
    {"name": "rotate shortcuts follow the step and the direction; a new gesture starts from zero", "delivery": "shortcuts", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 1, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "rotation": 10, "expect": []}, {"phase": "changed", "rotation": 10, "expect": [{"shortcut": "rotateLeft"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "rotation": -40, "expect": [{"shortcut": "rotateRight"}, {"shortcut": "rotateRight"}]}, {"phase": "ended", "expect": []}, {"phase": "began", "rotation": 14, "expect": []}], "source": "PadMac"},
    {"name": "default steps are 0.25 and 15 degrees", "delivery": "shortcuts", "fallbacks": "defaultSteps", "panScale": 1, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "scale": 0.24, "rotation": 14.9, "expect": []}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": 0.02, "rotation": 0.2, "expect": [{"shortcut": "zoomIn"}, {"shortcut": "rotateLeft"}]}], "source": "PadMac"},
    {"name": "a burst is capped at 3 presses per axis and the excess dropped", "delivery": "shortcuts", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 1, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "scale": 100, "expect": [{"shortcut": "zoomIn"}, {"shortcut": "zoomIn"}, {"shortcut": "zoomIn"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": -0.1, "expect": []}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": -0.1, "expect": []}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": 0.35, "expect": [{"shortcut": "zoomIn"}]}], "note": "x101 is 20 steps; 3 are pressed, 17 dropped, the 0.68-step remainder carries", "source": "PadMac"},
    {"name": "missing shortcuts fall back to modifier+scroll and are reported once", "delivery": "shortcuts", "fallbacks": "none", "panScale": 1, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "scale": 0.1, "rotation": 20, "expect": [{"fallbackUnavailable": "zoom"}, {"zoomScroll": 30, "phase": "began"}, {"fallbackUnavailable": "rotate"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": 0.1, "rotation": 20, "expect": [{"zoomScroll": 30, "phase": "changed"}]}, {"phase": "ended", "expect": [{"zoomScroll": 0, "phase": "ended"}]}], "source": "PadMac"},
    {"name": "pan is scaled and phased", "delivery": "shortcuts", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 2, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "dx": 1, "dy": -3, "expect": [{"scroll": [2, -6], "phase": "began"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "dy": 1, "expect": [{"scroll": [0, 2], "phase": "changed"}]}, {"phase": "ended", "expect": [{"scroll": [0, 0], "phase": "ended"}]}], "source": "PadMac"},
    {"name": "native magnify and rotate, with the rotation dead zone", "delivery": "native", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 1, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "scale": 0.05, "rotation": 1, "expect": [{"gestureBegin": "zoom"}, {"magnify": 0, "phase": "began"}, {"magnify": 0.05, "phase": "changed"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "rotation": 1.5, "expect": []}, {"phase": "changed", "rotation": 1, "expect": [{"rotate": 0, "phase": "began"}, {"rotate": 3.5, "phase": "changed"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": -0.02, "rotation": -1, "expect": [{"magnify": -0.02, "phase": "changed"}, {"rotate": -1, "phase": "changed"}]}, {"phase": "ended", "expect": [{"magnify": 0, "phase": "ended"}, {"rotate": 0, "phase": "ended"}, {"gestureEnd": "zoom"}]}], "source": "PadMac"},
    {"name": "native rotation alone opens a rotation bracket", "delivery": "native", "fallbacks": "none", "panScale": 1, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "rotation": -5, "expect": [{"gestureBegin": "rotation"}, {"rotate": 0, "phase": "began"}, {"rotate": -5, "phase": "changed"}]}, {"phase": "cancelled", "expect": [{"rotate": 0, "phase": "cancelled"}, {"gestureEnd": "rotation"}]}], "source": "PadMac"},
    {"name": "a began without an end cancels the open gesture first", "delivery": "native", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 1, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "scale": 0.1, "dy": 1, "expect": [{"gestureBegin": "zoom"}, {"magnify": 0, "phase": "began"}, {"magnify": 0.1, "phase": "changed"}, {"scroll": [0, 1], "phase": "began"}]}, {"phase": "began", "scale": 0.1, "expect": [{"magnify": 0, "phase": "cancelled"}, {"gestureEnd": "zoom"}, {"scroll": [0, 0], "phase": "cancelled"}, {"gestureBegin": "zoom"}, {"magnify": 0, "phase": "began"}, {"magnify": 0.1, "phase": "changed"}]}, {"phase": "cancelled", "expect": [{"magnify": 0, "phase": "cancelled"}, {"gestureEnd": "zoom"}]}], "source": "PadMac"},
    {"name": "scroll delivery is the 1.2 behaviour", "delivery": "scroll", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 1, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "scale": 0.1, "rotation": 30, "expect": [{"zoomScroll": 30, "phase": "began"}]}, {"phase": "ended", "expect": [{"zoomScroll": 0, "phase": "ended"}]}], "source": "PadMac"},
    {"name": "an unknown delivery is native", "delivery": "touchContacts", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 1, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "scale": 0.1, "expect": [{"gestureBegin": "zoom"}, {"magnify": 0, "phase": "began"}, {"magnify": 0.1, "phase": "changed"}]}], "source": "PadMac"},
    {"name": "a fallback's own Windows key", "delivery": "shortcuts", "fallbacks": "perHost", "panScale": 1, "host": "windows", "messages": [{"phase": "began", "scale": 0.3, "expect": [{"shortcut": "zoomIn", "message": {"key": {"char": "="}, "modifiers": 2}}]}], "source": "core"},
    {"name": "the Mac keeps the shared key", "delivery": "shortcuts", "fallbacks": "perHost", "panScale": 1, "host": "mac", "messages": [{"phase": "began", "scale": 0.3, "expect": [{"shortcut": "zoomIn", "message": {"key": {"char": "+"}, "modifiers": 8}}]}], "source": "core"},
    {"name": "pan as a middle-button drag starts past 4 points", "delivery": "shortcuts", "pan": "middleDrag", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 2, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "dx": 1, "expect": []}, {"phase": "changed", "dy": 2, "expect": [{"panDrag": [2, 4], "via": "middleDrag", "phase": "began"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "dx": -1, "dy": 0.5, "expect": [{"panDrag": [-2, 1], "via": "middleDrag", "phase": "changed"}]}, {"phase": "ended", "expect": [{"panDrag": [0, 0], "via": "middleDrag", "phase": "ended"}]}], "source": "core"},
    {"name": "a drag is released before a zoom shortcut and starts again", "delivery": "shortcuts", "pan": "spaceDrag", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 1, "host": "windows", "messages": [{"phase": "began", "dx": 5, "expect": [{"panDrag": [5, 0], "via": "spaceDrag", "phase": "began"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": 0.3, "dx": 1, "expect": [{"panDrag": [0, 0], "via": "spaceDrag", "phase": "ended"}, {"shortcut": "zoomIn"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "dx": 3, "expect": [{"panDrag": [4, 0], "via": "spaceDrag", "phase": "began"}]}, {"phase": "cancelled", "expect": [{"panDrag": [0, 0], "via": "spaceDrag", "phase": "cancelled"}]}], "source": "core"},
    {"name": "modifier+scroll zoom also releases the drag", "delivery": "scroll", "pan": "middleDrag", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 1, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "dx": 4, "expect": [{"panDrag": [4, 0], "via": "middleDrag", "phase": "began"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": 0.1, "expect": [{"panDrag": [0, 0], "via": "middleDrag", "phase": "ended"}, {"zoomScroll": 30, "phase": "began"}]}, {"phase": "ended", "expect": [{"zoomScroll": 0, "phase": "ended"}]}], "source": "core"},
    {"name": "native zoom keeps the drag", "delivery": "native", "pan": "middleDrag", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 1, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "dx": 4, "expect": [{"panDrag": [4, 0], "via": "middleDrag", "phase": "began"}]}, {"phase": "changed", "scale": 0.1, "dx": 1, "expect": [{"gestureBegin": "zoom"}, {"magnify": 0, "phase": "began"}, {"magnify": 0.1, "phase": "changed"}, {"panDrag": [1, 0], "via": "middleDrag", "phase": "changed"}]}, {"phase": "ended", "expect": [{"magnify": 0, "phase": "ended"}, {"gestureEnd": "zoom"}, {"panDrag": [0, 0], "via": "middleDrag", "phase": "ended"}]}], "source": "core"},
    {"name": "an unknown pan is the scroll", "delivery": "shortcuts", "pan": "orbit", "fallbacks": "standard", "panScale": 1, "messages": [{"phase": "began", "dx": 1, "expect": [{"scroll": [1, 0], "phase": "began"}]}], "source": "core"}
  ],
  "steps": [
    {"name": "small pinches add up to one step", "zoomStep": 0.25, "rotateStepDegrees": 15, "feeds": [{"scale": 0.1, "rotation": 0, "expect": [0, 0]}, {"scale": 0.1, "rotation": 0, "expect": [0, 0]}, {"scale": 0.1, "rotation": 0, "expect": [1, 0]}, {"scale": 0.1, "rotation": 0, "expect": [0, 0]}]},
    {"name": "spread and pinch back cancel", "zoomStep": 0.25, "rotateStepDegrees": 15, "feeds": [{"scale": 0.2, "rotation": 0, "expect": [0, 0]}, {"scale": -0.16666666666666663, "rotation": 0, "expect": [0, 0]}, {"scale": 0.2, "rotation": 0, "expect": [0, 0]}]},
    {"name": "pinching in zooms out", "zoomStep": 0.25, "rotateStepDegrees": 15, "feeds": [{"scale": -0.3, "rotation": 0, "expect": [-1, 0]}, {"scale": -0.36, "rotation": 0, "expect": [-2, 0]}]},
    {"name": "zoomStep sets the unit", "zoomStep": 0.1, "rotateStepDegrees": 15, "feeds": [{"scale": 0.22, "rotation": 0, "expect": [2, 0]}]},
    {"name": "rotation carries its remainder both ways", "zoomStep": 0.25, "rotateStepDegrees": 15, "feeds": [{"scale": 0, "rotation": 10, "expect": [0, 0]}, {"scale": 0, "rotation": 10, "expect": [0, 1]}, {"scale": 0, "rotation": -25, "expect": [0, -1]}, {"scale": 0, "rotation": 5, "expect": [0, 0]}]},
